    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "Three Raptors",
        "content": "The Raptors are three heroes of 7 health each, each with its own health dial. A defeated Raptor leaves the board; you lose only when all three are defeated. An effect on your \"hero\" affects every one of your Raptors. Here: the hero is one Raptor and the other two are the \"Raptor\" sidekicks, each with its own 7-health counter."
